# SailPoint Utils Cursor Rules

## SailPoint Connect Versioning Rule
Every commit that touches files under `ISC/SailPoint Connect/` MUST include a version bump:
- Default: **minor** version bump (e.g., `1.2.0` -> `1.3.0`), unless the user explicitly requests otherwise.
- Update `ModuleVersion` in `ISC/SailPoint Connect/SailPoint.Connect.psd1`.
- Add an entry in `CHANGELOG.md` (`## YYYY-MM-DD · vX.Y.Z`).
- Update `Get-SailPointConnectVersion` in `ISC/SailPoint Connect/modules/ISC.OperatorConsole.psm1`.
- Update version test assertions in `ISC/SailPoint Connect/tests/Test-OperatorConsole.ps1`.
- Run `pwsh "ISC/SailPoint Connect/tests/Invoke-AllSourceConnectionTests.ps1"` before committing.

See `AGENTS.md` for full instructions.
